Copy vaults.example.json to vaults.json and replace the example paths with your own. If you only want to sync one vault, you can simply delete the other entries.

[
  {
    "name": "MyVault1",
    "main": "C:\\Path\\To\\Your\\Obsidian\\MyVault1",
    "nlm": "C:\\Path\\To\\Your\\NotebookLM\\Folder"
  },
  {
    "name": "MyVault2",
    "main": "C:\\Path\\To\\Your\\Obsidian\\MyVault2",
    "nlm": "C:\\Path\\To\\Your\\NotebookLM\\Folder"
  },
  {
    "name": "MyVault3",
    "main": "C:\\Path\\To\\Your\\Obsidian\\MyVault3",
    "nlm": "C:\\Path\\To\\Your\\NotebookLM\\Folder"
  }
]